a sci-fi adventure movie starring William Hurt, Matt LeBlanc, Gary Oldman, and Heather Graham. Directed by Stephen Hopkins, the movie also saw some actors from the original series make cameo appearances.\\n\\nThe show was also remade as another ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.monstercomplex.com/blog/23-iconic-robot-tv-showsincluding-robot-monster-on-mst3k-star-trek-westworld-and-more\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d15\"},\"ref\":\"d15\",\"snippet\":\" ... Click below on your favorite genre and dive into the wonderful world of silent film with two suggestions tailored to your specific tastes and interests!\\n\\nIntroduction—Animation—Comedy—Documentary—Fantasy—Gangster—Historical Epic—Horror—Melodrama—Romantic Comedy—Sci-Fi—Social Issue Drama—Western\\n\\nAnimation\\n\\nThe Adventures of Prince ... \",\"title\":\"https://theeverydaycinephile.com/blogathons/12-genres-24-must-see-silent-movie-day/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"1144f7f5b91bb669520614fafa2a11a72115e7b9f952062814de6000e8cacc91\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"b7bff963946a772666f7d73c595a7cc7fab7dc5e6e8b741184e1ce502f7f6494\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"dinosaur sci-fi adventure English film series director\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_9e3bb5708b704645a49e22ba"},{"content":"The clue about \"dinosaur, sci-fi, and adventure films\" strongly suggests Ray Harryhausen, known for his stop-motion creature films. Let me search more specifically.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Ray Harryhausen film 91 minutes actor Indian\", \"short film directed with nephew Ray Harryhausen cast\", \"actor born 1950s Indian immigrant parents H