igation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d19\"},\"ref\":\"d19\",\"snippet\":\" ... his 1981 film Clash of the Titans.\\n\\nIndeed, Ray Harryhausen's Medusa is one of the most recognisable characters in model-animation cinema history.\\n\\nFor such a pivotal character in the Ray Harryhausen canon of creations, Medusa spends little time on screen—just under five minutes—and yet ... \",\"title\":\"https://blog.scienceandmediamuseum.org.uk/ray-harryhausen-changed-our-perception-of-medusa-forever/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d20\"},\"ref\":\"d20\",\"snippet\":\" ... 1 star added to the deserved 'awful' rating for sheer goofiness, and also for the naiveté and optimism that permeates the film.\\n\\nDid you know\\n\\n- TriviaMr. BIG (Bert I Gordon) actually reviewed dinosaur footage brought in by Ray Harryhausen and Ray Bradbury and did not even acknowledge them ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0048256/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"28274a272e79ac5070316f4147e1276fd7e90699e5f9656e739a4338e691b431\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"58cfe893650c47498eafb14df585b09e89cbcf4f79ac5b9b3777c805bf4ab899\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Ray Harryhausen film 91 minutes actor Indian\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d16\"},\"ref\":\"d16\",\"snippet\":\" ... Films of Ray Harryhausen: Features, Early 16mm Experiments and Unrealized Projects. Jefferson, N.C.: McFarland & Co., 2004, p. 193.\\n\\nCasting\\n\\nSchneer deliberately sought better known actors to play the Gods to improve the film's chances at the box office. \\\"If we had played this picture with no ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clash_of_the_Titans_(1981_film)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\" ... Variety magazine wrote: \\\"The $3 million film has a workable scenario and has been directed resourcefully and spiritedly by Don Chaffey, under whose leadership a colorful cast performs with zeal.\\\"\\n\\nRay Harryhausen regarded the film as his best.Jason and the Argonauts. Culver City: Columbia TriStar Home Video ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jason_and_the_Argonauts_(1963_film)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d19\"},\"ref\":\"d19\",\"snippet\":\" ... film The Gorgon, directed by Terence Fisher. Played by Prudence Hyman with rubber snakes in her hair, the character looked more like Cinderella's Stepmother than a fearsome vengeful creature (Harryhausen never referred to his creations as monsters).\\n\\nThe earliest illustration of Medusa in the Ray Harryhausen Collection ... \",\"title\":\"https://blog.scienceandmediamuseum.org.uk/ray-harryhausen-changed-our-perception-of-medusa-forever/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d21\"},\"ref\":\"d21\",\"snippet\":\" ... Despite Bubo's similarities (Bubo is metallic and expresses by whistling and rotating its head) to the droid R2-D2 of the 1977 film Star Wars, Harryhausen claimed Bubo was created before Star Wars was released.Ray Harryhausen and Tony Dalton, Ray Harryhausen: An Animated Life, page 270 ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Star_Wars_sources_and_analogues\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d22\"},\"ref\":\"d22\",\"snippet\":\" ... Documentaries\\n\\n* The Fantasy Film Worlds of George Pal (1985), produced and directed by Arnold Leibovit, Bradbury appeared in the documentary.\\n*\\n* Interview with Ray Bradbury (1979) at California State University, Northridge\\n\\nCitations\\n\\nGeneral and cited sources\\n\\n* \\n* \\n* \\n* \\n* \\n* \\n* \\n* \\n* \\n* \\n\\nExternal links\\n\\n* \\n* Center for Ray Bradbury Studies, at Indiana University Purdue University Indian\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ray_Bradbury\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"61992105496d33fcae6688646938309093fcda3fe68eac575a3ae80858b9d217\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"6f3caab30193bd0077eb63e22c66425fce3b7497d900248221b6d31764fad3a2\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"short film directed with nephew Ray Harryhausen cast\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d16\"},\"ref\":\"d16\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Dinosaur Films of Ray Harryhausen: Features, Early 16mm Experiments and Unrealized Projects. Jefferson, N.C.: McFarland & Co., 2004, p. 193.\\n\\nCasting\\n\\nSchneer deliberately sought better known actors to play the Gods to improve the film's chances at the box office. \\\"If we had played this picture ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clash_of_the_Titans_(1981_film)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d22\"},\"